{
  "apiVersion": "dashboard.grafana.app/v1beta1",
  "kind": "Dashboard",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "crok-feedback",
    "annotations": {
      "grafana.app/folder": "llm-observability"
    }
  },
  "spec": {
    "title": "crok Feedback",
    "description": "The user's thumbs on crok's replies: positive feedback rate, volume, and the minimum-sample rule behind it. The same series feed the monthly 80% SLO and the low-rate alert.",
    "tags": [
      "llm-observability",
      "feedback",
      "evaluation"
    ],
    "timezone": "browser",
    "editable": true,
    "graphTooltip": 1,
    "schemaVersion": 41,
    "time": {
      "from": "now-30d",
      "to": "now"
    },
    "refresh": "30s",
    "timepicker": {
      "refresh_intervals": [
        "30s",
        "1m",
        "5m",
        "15m",
        "30m",
        "1h"
      ]
    },
    "links": [
      {
        "type": "dashboards",
        "tags": [
          "llm-observability"
        ],
        "asDropdown": false,
        "title": "LLM dashboards",
        "includeVars": false,
        "keepTime": true,
        "targetBlank": false
      }
    ],
    "templating": {
      "list": [
        {
          "type": "datasource",
          "name": "prom",
          "label": "Metrics",
          "query": "prometheus",
          "regex": "",
          "refresh": 1,
          "hide": 0,
          "current": {
            "selected": true,
            "text": "grafanacloud-narrowgrotto289-prom",
            "value": "grafanacloud-prom"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "annotations": {
      "list": []
    },
    "panels": [
      {
        "type": "row",
        "title": "Evaluation (selected time range, at least 20 feedbacks)",
        "collapsed": false,
        "panels": [],
        "id": 1,
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 1,
          "w": 24,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Positive feedback rate",
        "description": "Thumbs up divided by every turn with a thumb up or down. Shown only when the selected range holds at least 20 feedbacks; below that the 80% threshold does not apply.",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${prom}"
        },
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "percentunit",
            "decimals": 1,
            "noValue": "Not enough feedback (<20)",
            "color": {
              "mode": "thresholds"
            },
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "red",
                  "value": null
                },
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": 0.8
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "colorMode": "value",
          "graphMode": "area",
          "justifyMode": "center",
          "textMode": "auto",
          "orientation": "auto",
          "wideLayout": true,
          "showPercentChange": true
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "prometheus",
              "uid": "${prom}"
            },
            "instant": true,
            "range": false,
            "expr": "(sum(last_over_time(crok_feedback_rating[$__range]) > 0) / count(last_over_time(crok_feedback_rating[$__range]) != 0)) and on() (count(last_over_time(crok_feedback_rating[$__range]) != 0) >= 20)"
          }
        ],
        "id": 2,
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 5,
          "w": 9,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Feedback received",
        "description": "Turns with a current thumb verdict in the selected range. A thumb taken back is not a record.",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${prom}"
        },
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "short",
            "noValue": "0",
            "color": {
              "mode": "thresholds"
            },
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "red",
                  "value": null
                },
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": 20
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "colorMode": "value",
          "graphMode": "none",
          "justifyMode": "center",
          "textMode": "auto",
          "orientation": "auto",
          "wideLayout": true
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "prometheus",
              "uid": "${prom}"
            },
            "instant": true,
            "range": false,
            "expr": "count(last_over_time(crok_feedback_rating[$__range]) != 0)"
          }
        ],
        "id": 3,
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 5,
          "w": 5,
          "x": 9,
          "y": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Thumbs up",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${prom}"
        },
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "short",
            "noValue": "0",
            "color": {
              "mode": "fixed",
              "fixedColor": "green"
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "colorMode": "value",
          "graphMode": "none",
          "justifyMode": "center",
          "textMode": "auto"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "prometheus",
              "uid": "${prom}"
            },
            "instant": true,
            "range": false,
            "expr": "sum(last_over_time(crok_feedback_rating[$__range]) > 0)"
          }
        ],
        "id": 4,
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 5,
          "w": 5,
          "x": 14,
          "y": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Thumbs down",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${prom}"
        },
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "short",
            "noValue": "0",
            "color": {
              "mode": "fixed",
              "fixedColor": "red"
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "colorMode": "value",
          "graphMode": "none",
          "justifyMode": "center",
          "textMode": "auto"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "prometheus",
              "uid": "${prom}"
            },
            "instant": true,
            "range": false,
            "expr": "sum(last_over_time(crok_feedback_rating[$__range]) < 0)"
          }
        ],
        "id": 5,
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 5,
          "w": 5,
          "x": 19,
          "y": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "row",
        "title": "Over time",
        "collapsed": false,
        "panels": [],
        "id": 6,
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 1,
          "w": 24,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 6
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Positive feedback rate (rolling selected range)",
        "description": "The same ratio at each step, over the selected range ending at that step. Before 20 feedbacks the gate empties the series, so a thin period shows no line rather than a misleading rate.",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${prom}"
        },
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "percentunit",
            "decimals": 1,
            "min": 0,
            "max": 1,
            "custom": {
              "drawStyle": "line",
              "lineInterpolation": "linear",
              "lineWidth": 2,
              "fillOpacity": 8,
              "showPoints": "never",
              "spanNulls": false
            },
            "color": {
              "mode": "thresholds"
            },
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "red",
                  "value": null
                },
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": 0.8
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "legend": {
            "displayMode": "list",
            "placement": "bottom",
            "showLegend": true
          },
          "tooltip": {
            "mode": "single",
            "sort": "none"
          }
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "prometheus",
              "uid": "${prom}"
            },
            "expr": "(sum(last_over_time(crok_feedback_rating[$__range]) > 0) / count(last_over_time(crok_feedback_rating[$__range]) != 0)) and on() (count(last_over_time(crok_feedback_rating[$__range]) != 0) >= 20)"
          }
        ],
        "id": 7,
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 8,
          "w": 12,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 7
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Feedback by surface",
        "description": "Current thumbs per surface: the terminal and Crok Desktop. A turn changes or retracts its own series, so each surface shows its latest verdicts.",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${prom}"
        },
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "short",
            "custom": {
              "drawStyle": "bars",
              "lineWidth": 1,
              "fillOpacity": 60,
              "showPoints": "never",
              "stacking": {
                "mode": "normal",
                "group": "A"
              }
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "legend": {
            "displayMode": "list",
            "placement": "bottom",
            "showLegend": true
          },
          "tooltip": {
            "mode": "multi",
            "sort": "desc"
          }
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "prometheus",
              "uid": "${prom}"
            },
            "instant": true,
            "range": false,
            "expr": "sum by (surface) (last_over_time(crok_feedback_rating[$__range]) != 0)"
          }
        ],
        "id": 8,
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 8,
          "w": 12,
          "x": 12,
          "y": 7
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "row",
        "title": "How this is measured",
        "collapsed": false,
        "panels": [],
        "id": 9,
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 1,
          "w": 24,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 15
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "title": "Evaluation and SLO",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${prom}"
        },
        "options": {
          "mode": "markdown",
          "code": {
            "language": "plaintext",
            "showLineNumbers": false,
            "showMiniMap": false
          },
          "content": "## Good rate\n\n`positive = sum(last_over_time(crok_feedback_rating[range]) > 0)`  \n`feedback = count(last_over_time(crok_feedback_rating[range]) != 0)`  \n`good rate = positive / feedback`\n\nThe threshold is **80%**, and it applies only when `feedback >= 20` in the selected range. Below 20 the stat, the time series and the alert return no data, so a quiet period cannot trip the SLO.\n\n`crok_feedback_rating` is a gauge with one series per conversation turn: `1` thumbs up, `-1` thumbs down, `0` the user took the verdict back. Changing a thumb overwrites the same series, so reverted feedback leaves no stale record in the ratio.\n\n## Monthly SLO\n\nThe `crok feedback is mostly good` SLO measures the same ratio over 30 days against an 80% objective. Its query carries the same 20-feedback gate.\n\n## Source\n\nCrok Desktop sends the reply's thumb through `_x.ai/feedback/rating`; the TUI sends the answer to the question under a finished turn (`/good`, `/not-so-well`, `/dont-show-again`). The shell records each change on the Agent Observability conversation and in this gauge."
        },
        "id": 10,
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 10,
          "w": 24,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 16
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
